00:01:01.718 --> 00:01:05.260
(quirky jazz music)
(keyboard clicking)

00:01:05.260 --> 00:01:06.093
(soft piano melody)
To put it simply,

00:01:06.093 --> 00:01:07.470
a vaccine is an introduction

00:01:07.470 --> 00:01:10.360
of a virus or part of a virus

00:01:10.360 --> 00:01:12.740
