00:01:24.473 --> 00:01:26.500
- I think they're real like, experiments,

00:01:26.500 --> 00:01:28.450
and the put the,

00:01:28.450 --> 00:01:29.640
the, you know,

00:01:29.640 --> 00:01:31.250
virus in us so,

00:01:31.250 --> 00:01:32.310
- Did your doctor try and like,

00:01:32.310 --> 00:01:34.070
push you or convince you to do 'em?

00:01:34.070 --> 00:01:34.903
- Yeah.

00:01:34.903 --> 00:01:35.736
Like, always.

00:01:35.736 --> 00:01:36.670
They always do that.

00:01:36.670 --> 00:01:38.310
- Why do you think they do that?

00:01:38.310 --> 00:01:39.860
- They get paid for this shit!

00:01:39.860 --> 00:01:40.860
Look.
(both laugh)

00:01:40.860 --> 00:01:42.385
- Thank you so much, I appreciate it

00:01:42.385 --> 00:01:43.930
(crowd awws)

00:01:43.930 --> 00:01:46.850
- Vaccines are not a
blockbuster hit for doctors

00:01:46.850 --> 00:01:48.430
or pharmaceutical companies.

00:01:48.430 --> 00:01:49.910
Most of the money that's dedicated

00:01:49.910 --> 00:01:51.339
to this research goes to universities.

00:01:51.339 --> 00:01:52.172
(static buzzes)

00:01:52.172 --> 00:01:53.005
(soft pensive bells)
- It's as heart wrenching

00:01:53.005 --> 00:01:54.770
as it gets, autism and children.

00:01:54.770 --> 00:01:57.420
- Well the vast majority of
medical experts insist that

00:01:57.420 --> 00:01:59.530
vaccines are generally safe.

00:01:59.530 --> 00:02:01.900
- You're going to stand on
the stage and say vaccines

00:02:01.900 --> 00:02:03.220
and autism are unrelated?

00:02:03.220 --> 00:02:04.270
It is the most bogus

00:02:04.270 --> 00:02:07.350
- I've seen the correlations
between multiple vaccines

00:02:07.350 --> 00:02:09.130
at a very young age,

00:02:09.130 --> 00:02:11.350
and autism, and other
problems that people have.

00:02:11.350 --> 00:02:12.183
- People think

00:02:13.290 --> 00:02:14.370
autism or whatever

00:02:14.370 --> 00:02:16.640
is a risk of
- Yeah that's going around.

00:02:16.640 --> 00:02:18.313
Can I tell you a like
a little history about,

00:02:18.313 --> 00:02:19.830
it's really interesting.

00:02:19.830 --> 00:02:21.340
So in 1998,

00:02:21.340 --> 00:02:23.060
this guy, he was a doctor at the time,

00:02:23.060 --> 00:02:24.380
his name is Dr. Wakefield.

00:02:24.380 --> 00:02:26.200
He did this study on 12 kids,

00:02:26.200 --> 00:02:28.720
not 1,000 kids, not 1 million, 12.

00:02:28.720 --> 00:02:32.150
Found that there was an
increased risk of getting autism

00:02:32.150 --> 00:02:33.670
if they got vaccine,

00:02:33.670 --> 00:02:35.880
this specific vaccine, MMR vaccine.

00:02:35.880 --> 00:02:37.360
Measles, mumps and rubella.

00:02:37.360 --> 00:02:42.360
He was paid 500 thousand dollars
to try and create this link

00:02:42.460 --> 00:02:43.980
because of a law company that

00:02:43.980 --> 00:02:45.820
wanted to make lawsuits, right?

00:02:45.820 --> 00:02:46.950
- Right
- And this is only

00:02:46.950 --> 00:02:47.920
12 kids he tested!

00:02:47.920 --> 00:02:50.070
So not like thousands, or 100 thousand,

00:02:50.070 --> 00:02:52.000
and he found that there
was an increased risk,

00:02:52.000 --> 00:02:52.860
and it was published.

00:02:52.860 --> 00:02:54.310
They took away his medical license,

00:02:54.310 --> 00:02:55.600
there was a really big deal about it.

00:02:55.600 --> 00:02:57.828
I cannot say this more clearly;

00:02:57.828 --> 00:03:00.580
there has been no association

00:03:00.580 --> 00:03:03.340
between autism and vaccination.

00:03:03.340 --> 00:03:04.173
Zero.

00:03:04.173 --> 00:03:05.006
None.

00:03:05.006 --> 00:03:07.480
- If you had to convince
someone that told you that

00:03:07.480 --> 00:03:09.230
despite like the best
research that you've seen

00:03:09.230 --> 00:03:10.690
that there is no link to autism,

00:03:10.690 --> 00:03:13.920
that they still believe that
there is a correlation somehow.

00:03:13.920 --> 00:03:16.260
- I would suggest to them that
having a child with autism

00:03:16.260 --> 00:03:18.520
is a lot better than having a dead child.

00:03:18.520 --> 00:03:19.790
You know what I mean?

00:03:19.790 --> 00:03:21.890
- What I do empathize
with you, and understand,

00:03:21.890 --> 00:03:23.670
is that the government telling people

00:03:23.670 --> 00:03:25.010
they have to get vaccines.

00:03:25.010 --> 00:03:26.267
- Right.

00:03:26.267 --> 00:03:27.500
If you don't do it, they're not to

00:03:27.500 --> 00:03:29.443
be registered in school.
- Can't go to school.

00:03:29.443 --> 00:03:30.276
(soft upbeat drums)
- That's a great

00:03:30.276 --> 00:03:32.124
thing to talk about because

00:03:32.124 --> 00:03:35.410
in one sense you want to
have control over your body,

00:03:35.410 --> 00:03:38.170
and what treatments are taken,

00:03:38.170 --> 00:03:40.210
and what illnesses you have,

00:03:40.210 --> 00:03:42.730
that's your right to
choose and all of that but,

00:03:42.730 --> 00:03:43.563
on the other hand,

00:03:43.563 --> 00:03:44.580
if you don't get immunized,

00:03:44.580 --> 00:03:45.860
you can harm other people.

00:03:45.860 --> 00:03:47.580
And the reason why you
put people at risk is

00:03:47.580 --> 00:03:50.910
because not every child
can get the vaccine.

00:03:50.910 --> 00:03:52.250
Not every child can be immunized.

00:03:52.250 --> 00:03:54.930
Some have a genetic deficiency in

00:03:54.930 --> 00:03:56.550
their immune system where

00:03:56.550 --> 00:03:57.700
vaccines don't work on them.

00:03:57.700 --> 00:04:01.210
- In France we have a culture pro-vaccine

00:04:01.210 --> 00:04:02.285
but now."

00:04:02.285 --> 00:04:03.890
- I've heard recently in France

00:04:03.890 --> 00:04:05.240
it's changing a little bit,
- Yeah that's true

00:04:05.240 --> 00:04:06.810
- and they're thinking
about making it a law.

00:04:06.810 --> 00:04:08.510
The international community stands

00:04:08.510 --> 00:04:10.530
firmly with the US on this one.

00:04:10.530 --> 00:04:13.320
They believe every child
should be vaccinated,

00:04:13.320 --> 00:04:15.350
and in fact, there is such
a shortage in vaccines

00:04:15.350 --> 00:04:18.510
throughout the world UNICEF
says that about one child

00:04:18.510 --> 00:04:20.850
dies every 20 seconds from a disease

00:04:20.850 --> 00:04:22.330
preventable by vaccine.

00:04:22.330 --> 00:04:25.330
I heard today and I hear a
lot of times from my patients

00:04:25.330 --> 00:04:26.730
that they worry that
their kids are getting

00:04:26.730 --> 00:04:28.460
too many vaccines all at once,

00:04:28.460 --> 00:04:30.120
or they're getting too many boosters

00:04:30.120 --> 00:04:31.670
in the first two years of life,

00:04:31.670 --> 00:04:33.780
and look, the important
things to remember,

00:04:33.780 --> 00:04:36.020
and what I really want to reassure you of,

00:04:36.020 --> 00:04:38.680
is that that schedule
is there for a reason.

00:04:38.680 --> 00:04:40.230
It's not based on a personal whim,

00:04:40.230 --> 00:04:42.490
it's not based on one
person's expert opinion.

00:04:42.490 --> 00:04:43.820
It's based on data.

00:04:43.820 --> 00:04:46.120
Quality studies that
prove this is the best way

00:04:46.120 --> 00:04:47.566
to deliver those vaccines.

00:04:47.566 --> 00:04:50.519
(quirky jazz music)
(keyboard clicking)

00:04:50.519 --> 00:04:51.352
(smooth jazz music)
I tell this

00:04:51.352 --> 00:04:52.660
over and over again to my patients,

00:04:52.660 --> 00:04:54.690
and especially when I'm
giving them the flu shot

00:04:54.690 --> 00:04:57.950
that they can't get the
flu from the flu shot.

00:04:57.950 --> 00:05:01.080
The reason why people start
thinking that is because

00:05:01.080 --> 00:05:02.770
the season of when we give the flu shot

00:05:02.770 --> 00:05:04.500
is the most common time
of year that people

00:05:04.500 --> 00:05:06.550
generally get colds and other viruses.

00:05:06.550 --> 00:05:09.830
Just because two things happen
generally at the same time

00:05:09.830 --> 00:05:12.080
doesn't mean one of those things
caused the other to happen.

00:05:12.080 --> 00:05:13.670
- For those that were talking about

00:05:13.670 --> 00:05:16.060
chemicals being found in our vaccines,

00:05:16.060 --> 00:05:17.110
it's true that there are small

00:05:17.110 --> 00:05:18.410
minute quantities of chemicals,

00:05:18.410 --> 00:05:20.330
like for example, aluminum,

00:05:20.330 --> 00:05:23.350
that stabilize the vaccine or help prevent

00:05:23.350 --> 00:05:25.640
bacterial and fungal growth but,

00:05:25.640 --> 00:05:28.070
the amount of aluminum
that's found in a vaccine

00:05:28.070 --> 00:05:31.170
is less that the amount
you find in baby formula

00:05:31.170 --> 00:05:33.210
or breast milk, think about that.

00:05:33.210 --> 00:05:34.580
Just like with everything else in life,

00:05:34.580 --> 00:05:36.260
vaccines do carry some risks.

00:05:36.260 --> 00:05:38.440
However, most of these
risks are fairly minor.

00:05:38.440 --> 00:05:40.570
Redness or swelling of the injection site,

00:05:40.570 --> 00:05:41.600
a mild fever,

00:05:41.600 --> 00:05:42.870
nothing serious.

00:05:42.870 --> 00:05:44.590
There are more serious complications

00:05:44.590 --> 00:05:45.520
like anaphylaxis

00:05:45.520 --> 00:05:47.830
which is a life threatening
allergic reaction,

00:05:47.830 --> 00:05:50.610
but it happens less than
one in 1 million cases

00:05:50.610 --> 00:05:53.330
and can be fully reversible
by a healthcare professional.

00:05:53.330 --> 00:05:56.210
As a doctor, my job is to
always weigh the benefits

00:05:56.210 --> 00:05:57.940
versus the risk when doing anything.

00:05:57.940 --> 00:05:59.990
You're always forced to make decisions,

00:05:59.990 --> 00:06:02.100
and a lot of the time you
have to make decisions

00:06:02.100 --> 00:06:03.710
with incomplete information.

00:06:03.710 --> 00:06:06.850
But your job is to find the
best incomplete information

00:06:06.850 --> 00:06:08.770
and use that to make a decision.

00:06:08.770 --> 00:06:11.460
In this case, for vaccines,
we may learn something

00:06:11.460 --> 00:06:13.090
new about vaccines in the coming years.

00:06:13.090 --> 00:06:15.590
We may learn that they
weren't as good as we thought,

00:06:15.590 --> 00:06:17.070
or there is some other adverse

00:06:17.070 --> 00:06:18.320
effects that we haven't thought of,

00:06:18.320 --> 00:06:20.720
but right now, the information
that's available to you,

00:06:20.720 --> 00:06:22.160
the quality information,

00:06:22.160 --> 00:06:24.840
shows that vaccines are good.

00:06:24.840 --> 00:06:26.880
They have higher benefit than risk,

00:06:26.880 --> 00:06:28.180
and they protect us.

00:06:28.180 --> 00:06:31.444
So there is no doubt, vaccinate
yourself and your kids.

00:06:31.444 --> 00:06:32.277
